activity Prepare Solution
activity Heat Mixture
activity Add Catalyst
activity Monitor Reaction
activity Cool Solution
activity Filter Product
activity Dry Product
activity Analyze Sample
activity Store Product
activity Dispose Waste
bind Prepare Solution: Concentration, Solvent Type
bind Heat Mixture: Temperature
bind Add Catalyst: Catalyst Type
bind Monitor Reaction: Reaction Status, Reaction Time
bind Analyze Sample: Purity, Yield
bind Store Product: Batch Number
Temperature: float between 0.0 and 500.0
Reaction Time: integer between 1 and 600
Catalyst Type: Platinum, Palladium, Nickel, Iron
Concentration: float between 0.1 and 10.0
Solvent Type: Water, Ethanol, Toluene
Yield: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Purity: integer between 0 and 100
Reaction Status: Initiated, Ongoing, Completed, Failed
Batch Number: integer between 1 and 1000
Init[Prepare Solution] | |
End[Store Product] | |
Existence[Monitor Reaction] | |
Absence2[Dispose Waste] | |
Exactly[Analyze Sample] | |
Responded Existence[Add Catalyst, Heat Mixture] | | |
Precedence[Heat Mixture, Prepare Solution] | |T.Concentration > 0.1 |
Precedence[Filter Product, Cool Solution] | | |
Response[Add Catalyst, Monitor Reaction] |A.Catalyst Type is Platinum |T.Reaction Status is Ongoing |
Response[Filter Product, Dry Product] | | |
Succession[Cool Solution, Filter Product] | | |
Alternate Precedence[Dry Product, Filter Product] | | |
Alternate Response[Add Catalyst, Monitor Reaction] | | |
Alternate Succession[Prepare Solution, Heat Mixture] | | |
Chain Precedence[Analyze Sample, Dry Product] | | |
Chain Response[Heat Mixture, Add Catalyst] |A.Temperature > 100.0 | |
Chain Succession[Filter Product, Dry Product] | | |
Co-Existence[Analyze Sample, Store Product] | | |
Choice[Analyze Sample, Dispose Waste] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Store Product, Dispose Waste] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Dispose Waste, Store Product] |A.Reaction Status is Failed | |
Not Responded Existence[Dispose Waste, Store Product] | | |
Not Precedence[Analyze Sample, Store Product] | | |
Not Response[Dispose Waste, Heat Mixture] | | |
Not Succession[Store Product, Add Catalyst] | | |
Not Chain Precedence[Analyze Sample, Cool Solution] | | |
Not Chain Response[Prepare Solution, Add Catalyst] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Monitor Reaction, Store Product] | | |